OL,3,GNEWSAProstate cancer plan helping men
OL,4,Aregain strength
OL,5,
OL,6,FMen undergoing treatment for prostate
OL,7,Fcancer say an exercise programme has
OL,8,Fhelped them overcome fatigue, regain
OL,9,Fstrength and improve their quality of
OL,10,Flife.
OL,12,FThe free 24-week Cancer Activity
OL,13,FProgramme (CAP), offered by Nuffield
OL,14,FHealth in partnership with NHS trusts,
OL,15,Fsupports men prescribed androgen
OL,16,Fdeprivation therapy (ADT), used to slow
OL,17,Fprostate cancer growth.
OL,19,FMike James, from Shirehampton, Bristol,
OL,20,Fsaid treatment left him feeling "weak
OL,21,Fand demoralised", but the programme
OL,22,Fhelped him regain his strength.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
