OL,3,GNEWSAProstate cancer plan helping men
OL,4,Aregain strength
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme follows findings from
OL,7,FSheffield Hallam University's STAMINA
OL,8,Ftrial, which found supervised exercise,
OL,9,Fdietary advice and behavioural support
OL,10,Fimproved quality of life and reduced
OL,11,Ffatigue.
